<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">We encourage all students to visit the campus of their major. <a href="https://visit.asu.edu/">Scheduling a campus visit</a> will provide you the opportunity to see what life is like as an ASU student.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You can customize your visit experience to include academic sessions, residential hall open houses, or a tour of Barrett, The Honors College.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, let me know and I’ll be happy to help!</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>